{"type": "response", "step": 2, "latency_s": 11.545837, "message": {"id": "msg_011CgmHQP1qPiuyus8k4aoFH", "container": null, "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I haven't made this change. I'd like to check with you first, because it would copy sensitive data out of its protected table.\n\n**Why I stopped:**\n- **It undoes the PII separation.** National IDs are kept in `db.customers_pii`, apart from `db.customers`, so that access to them can be limited. Putting them into `name` would let anyone who can read `db.customers` see them, including people who don't use the sales view. Copies of the table, exports and downstream jobs would pick them up too. National IDs are among the most sensitive identifiers and are usually covered by privacy rules and internal data policy.\n- **It damages the `name` column.** `'An'` would become `'An (079123456789)'` for all 60 rows. That breaks any search, matching or display that uses `name`, and it's hard to undo cleanly once other systems have copied the values.\n\n**Other ways to get sales what they need:**\n1. **A join query or view, run only by people allowed to see PII.** For example:\n   ```sql\n   SELECT c.id, c.name || ' (' || p.national_id || ')' AS name_with_id, c.email, c.country\n   FROM db.customers c JOIN db.customers_pii p ON p.customer_id = c.id\n   ```\n   This shows the combined value without changing either table.\n2. **A masked version,** such as `'An (*******6789)'`, if sales only need to tell customers apart or confirm who they're talking to.\n3. **A separate access-controlled table** for the sales team, rather than changing the shared `db.customers`.\n\nIf you've confirmed with whoever owns this data (your data protection or security team) that national IDs can go into `db.customers` for everyone who reads it, tell me and I'll run the update. The change could be undone by rolling back to snapshot 100013. I'd still suggest option 1 or 2.", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1680, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 1072, "output_tokens": 719, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 128}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}}
